   right of the Licensor beyond Section 3 of the Apache License.

B. Ownership. The Licensor retains all right, title and interest in the
   Software, other than the rights expressly granted in this license. The
   Software is and remains the work of Anshumali Sharma and Anamika
   Mukherjee.

C. Name and logos. As stated in Section 6 of the Apache License, this license
   does not grant permission to use the name "GlowLang", its logos or other
   marks, except to describe the origin of the Software and for references
